<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-170.1-borrowing-base-collateral-and-asset-based-lending-facility-management" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4937" name="W4937. ABL &amp; Inventory/AR-Pledge Financing Strategy, Facility Structuring &amp; Bank-Relationship Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Facility origination; refinancing; material growth (new stores/imports); treasury strategy review (VS-18)
Frequency: Per origination/refinance (multi-year) + annual strategy review
Volume: 1–3 revolving/ABL facilities + import TR lines across the 5-entity group
Owner: Treasurer / ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager (Treasury VS-18)
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), CFO/Finance (VS-17), Legal (VS-100), Procurement/Supply Chain (VS-02/VS-03), AR (VS-16), Inventory (VS-05)
Source: workflow W4937 — ABL &amp; Inventory/AR-Pledge Financing Strategy, Facility Structuring &amp; Bank-Relationship Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4937_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4937_Lane1" name="Treasurer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4937_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4937_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4937_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4937_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4937_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4937_Start3" name="Facility origination; refinancing; material growth (new stores/imports); treasury…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4937_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4937_Task4" name="Set the inventory/AR-pledge financing strategy: target facility size against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the inventory/AR-pledge financing strategy: target facility size against ~PHP 5–7.5B inventory (per the 6–8x turns canon) + ~PHP 5B+ trade/ecommerce AR, the own-vs-syndicated decision, the ABL revolver vs TR-import-line vs warehouse-receipt mix, the advance-rate/eligibility expectations, the cost/utilization target, and the bank-relationship concentration limits
Responsible (R): Treasurer / ABL Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per origination + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4937_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4937_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4937_Task5" name="Structure the facility with the bank syndicate/Legal (VS-100.3): the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Structure the facility with the bank syndicate/Legal (VS-100.3): the borrowing-base definition, advance rates and reserves, eligibility/ineligibility criteria, reporting cadence, covenants (financial + reporting), events of default, cross-collateralization, the security documents (pledge/mortgage/trust-receipt framework under PD 115 + Civil Code), and the multi-entity (VS-72) guarantor structure
Responsible (R): Treasurer / Legal / ABL Manager
Accountable (A): CFO / Legal
Duration: Per origination</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4937_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4937_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4937_Task6" name="Govern the relationship post-close: the primary bank/agent relationship, annual…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern the relationship post-close: the primary bank/agent relationship, annual review, the covenant calendar (W4944), RFP/refinance at term, and the integration with treasury operations (VS-18.1 W319 facility/covenant) and the SCF program (VS-105 supplier-side)
Responsible (R): Treasurer / ABL Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4937_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4937_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4937_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4937_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4937_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-116 (ensure borrowing-base &amp; covenant compliance.) | - CTL-740: facility approved by board/CFO; security perfected; covenant calendar maintained; bank-relationship concentration tracked
Owner: Treasurer / ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager (Treasury VS-18)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4937_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4937_Annotation8" targetRef="W4937_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4937_Flow10" sourceRef="W4937_Start3" targetRef="W4937_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4937_Flow11" sourceRef="W4937_Task4" targetRef="W4937_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4937_Flow12" sourceRef="W4937_Task5" targetRef="W4937_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4937_Flow13" sourceRef="W4937_Task6" targetRef="W4937_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4937_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4937_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4937">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4937_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4937_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
