    <bpmn:process id="W_W4938" name="W4938. Borrowing-Base Model, Advance-Rate Matrix &amp; Eligibility Criteria Definition" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Facility close (W4937); covenant reset; inventory/AR profile shift (imports, private label, B2B)
Frequency: Per facility + on material profile change
Volume: 1 borrowing-base model per facility × advance-rate matrix (inventory category × AR bucket)
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Finance
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), Treasury (VS-18), Inventory/Supply Chain (VS-05/VS-02), AR (VS-16), Data/Analytics (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4938 — Borrowing-Base Model, Advance-Rate Matrix &amp; Eligibility Criteria Definition</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4938_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4938_Lane1" name="ABL Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4938_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4938_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4938_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4938_Lane2" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4938_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4938_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4938_Start4" name="Facility close (W4937); covenant reset; inventory/AR profile shift (imports, private…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4938_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4938_Task5" name="Define the borrowing-base model per the credit agreement: eligible inventory (…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define the borrowing-base model per the credit agreement: eligible inventory ( Finished goods, raw/intermediate, import-in-transit treatment) × advance rate (e.g., 50–70% retail, lower for slow-moving/seasonal/SLOB); eligible AR (domestic trade, B2B, ecommerce) × advance rate (e.g., 80–90% current); less reserves (ineligibles, concentrations, floor); and the resulting availability formula
Responsible (R): ABL Manager / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): Treasurer / CFO
Duration: Per facility</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4938_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4938_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4938_Task6" name="Codify the eligibility/ineligibility criteria: eligible inventory excludes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Codify the eligibility/ineligibility criteria: eligible inventory excludes consignment/VMI (vendor-owned, VS-45), vendor-owned (W20), obsolete/SLOB (W220), damaged/quarantine (W91/W219), in-transit classification, and location eligibility (DC vs store vs in-transit); eligible AR excludes &gt;90-day aged, related-party, COD-cash, disputed, foreign without LC/insurance, and concentration-over-limit
Responsible (R): ABL Manager / Inventory / AR / Finance
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per facility</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4938_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4938_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4938_Task7" name="Configure the model in the treasury/ERP analytics (VS-28/VS-18): map inventory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Configure the model in the treasury/ERP analytics (VS-28/VS-18): map inventory categories (VS-01 assortment), AR aging buckets (VS-16), location hierarchy (VS-29), and reserves; validate against historical availability; and document for the periodic certificate (W4939)
Responsible (R): Analytics / ABL Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per facility</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4938_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4938_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4938_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4938_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4938_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-740 (ensure controlled execution — Borrowing-Base, Collateral &amp; Asset-Based Lending Facility Management (PA-170.1).) | - CTL-740: model reconciles to credit agreement; eligibility criteria documented; advance rates bank-confirmed; reserve basis documented
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4938_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4938_Annotation9" targetRef="W4938_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4938_Flow11" sourceRef="W4938_Start4" targetRef="W4938_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4938_Flow12" sourceRef="W4938_Task5" targetRef="W4938_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4938_Flow13" sourceRef="W4938_Task6" targetRef="W4938_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4938_Flow14" sourceRef="W4938_Task7" targetRef="W4938_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4938_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4938_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4938">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4938_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4938_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4938_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W4938_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4938_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W4938_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
