    <bpmn:process id="W_W4940" name="W4940. Eligible-Inventory Analysis, Locations &amp; In-Stock Eligibility Testing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Each borrowing-base cycle (W4939); field exam (W4943); inventory profile shift
Frequency: Monthly (+ event-driven)
Volume: ~35,000 active SKUs × ~205 locations (200 stores + 4 DCs + in-transit) tested per cycle
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Inventory Finance
Participants: Inventory/Supply Chain (VS-05/VS-02), Finance (VS-17), Data (VS-28), DC/Store Ops (VS-04/VS-07)
Source: workflow W4940 — Eligible-Inventory Analysis, Locations &amp; In-Stock Eligibility Testing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4940_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4940_Lane1" name="Inventory Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4940_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4940_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4940_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4940_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4940_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
