      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4940_Start3" name="Each borrowing-base cycle (W4939); field exam (W4943); inventory profile shift">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4940_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4940_Task4" name="Test inventory eligibility per the model (W4938): exclude…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Test inventory eligibility per the model (W4938): exclude vendor-owned/consignment/VMI (VS-45), damaged/quarantine (W91/W219), obsolete/SLOB (W220), aged/seasonal beyond limit, and samples/displays (VS-62); classify by category and advance rate; value at lower of cost/NRV (VS-17 W9)
Responsible (R): Inventory Finance / Analytics / Finance
Accountable (A): ABL Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4940_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4940_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4940_Task5" name="Validate location &amp; status eligibility: eligible only at approved DC/store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Validate location &amp; status eligibility: eligible only at approved DC/store locations (exclude in-transit unless eligible per agreement, exclude third-party/consignee-held), reconcile to the physical/ERP location hierarchy (VS-29), and flag location-status exceptions (closed stores VS-59, remodel VS-109)
Responsible (R): Inventory Finance / DC Ops / Store Ops / Analytics
Accountable (A): ABL Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4940_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4940_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4940_Task6" name="Reconcile to the inventory ledger &amp; cycle counts (VS-05.1 W6/W42): tie the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile to the inventory ledger &amp; cycle counts (VS-05.1 W6/W42): tie the eligible-inventory roll to the GL, apply shrink/accuracy (≥97% target), document reserves and ineligibles, and feed the certificate (W4939) and field-exam pack (W4943)
Responsible (R): Inventory Finance / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): Controller / ABL Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4940_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4940_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4940_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4940_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4940_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-740 (ensure controlled execution — Borrowing-Base, Collateral &amp; Asset-Based Lending Facility Management (PA-170.1).) | - CTL-740: eligibility auto-tested; reconciled to GL/cycle counts; shrink-adjusted; ineligibles documented
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Inventory Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4940_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4940_Annotation8" targetRef="W4940_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
