    <bpmn:process id="W_W4941" name="W4941. Eligible-Receivables Analysis, Aging &amp; Concentration Limits" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Each borrowing-base cycle (W4939); field exam (W4943); AR profile shift
Frequency: Monthly (+ event-driven)
Volume: ~5,200 trade + ~200 corporate accounts + ecommerce AR tested per cycle
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / AR Finance
Participants: AR/Order-to-Cash (VS-16), Finance (VS-17), Data (VS-28), Credit (VS-68/VS-16 W328)
Source: workflow W4941 — Eligible-Receivables Analysis, Aging &amp; Concentration Limits</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4941_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4941_Lane1" name="AR Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4941_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4941_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4941_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4941_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4941_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4941_Start3" name="Each borrowing-base cycle (W4939); field exam (W4943); AR profile shift">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4941_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4941_Task4" name="Test AR eligibility per the model (W4938): include domestic trade/corporate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Test AR eligibility per the model (W4938): include domestic trade/corporate current AR, exclude &gt;aging-limit (e.g., &gt;90 days), related-party/intercompany (VS-72), COD-cash, disputed/credit-held (VS-16 W8), foreign without LC/insurance/credit-cover (VS-68), and government receivables beyond limit; net of allowances (VS-16 W81) and returns/reserves (VS-32)
Responsible (R): AR Finance / Analytics / Credit
Accountable (A): ABL Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4941_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4941_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4941_Task5" name="Apply concentration limits: per-account/concentration caps (e.g., top-account…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Apply concentration limits: per-account/concentration caps (e.g., top-account and single-industry limits), aggregate the eligible pool, and flag breaches for reserve/eligibility adjustment; reconcile to the AR aging (VS-16) and the trade-credit-risk view (VS-68)
Responsible (R): AR Finance / Credit / Analytics
Accountable (A): ABL Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4941_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4941_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4941_Task6" name="Reconcile to the AR subledger &amp; remittance (VS-16): tie eligible AR to the GL…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile to the AR subledger &amp; remittance (VS-16): tie eligible AR to the GL, document ineligibles/reserves, integrate with collections (which reduce eligible AR — links W4942 availability), and feed the certificate (W4939) and field-exam pack (W4943)
Responsible (R): AR Finance / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): Controller / ABL Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4941_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4941_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4941_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4941_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4941_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-740 (ensure controlled execution — Borrowing-Base, Collateral &amp; Asset-Based Lending Facility Management (PA-170.1).) | - CTL-740: eligibility auto-tested (aging/concentration/related-party); reconciled to AR subledger; allowances applied; ineligibles documented
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / AR Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
