    <bpmn:process id="W_W4942" name="W4942. Availability Calculation, Draws, Repayments &amp; Excess-Availability Monitoring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily/weekly treasury cycle (VS-18); certificate (W4939); funding need; collection inflow
Frequency: Daily availability; draws/repayments event-driven
Volume: ~daily availability across 1–3 facilities; ~draws/repayments per working-capital cycle
Owner: Treasurer / Cash Manager (VS-18) / ABL Manager
Participants: Treasury/Cash (VS-18), Finance (VS-17), Collections (VS-16), Procurement/AP (VS-15)
Source: workflow W4942 — Availability Calculation, Draws, Repayments &amp; Excess-Availability Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4942_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4942_Lane1" name="Cash Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4942_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4942_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4942_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4942_Lane2" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4942_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4942_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4942_Start4" name="Daily/weekly treasury cycle (VS-18); certificate (W4939); funding need; collection inflow">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4942_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4942_Task5" name="Calculate availability daily from the latest certificate (W4939) +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Calculate availability daily from the latest certificate (W4939) + collection/AR roll-forward + inventory movements: borrowing base − outstanding loans/letters − reserves = available; track against utilization, excess-availability covenant thresholds, and the minimum-availability covenant
Responsible (R): Cash Manager / ABL Manager / Treasury
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4942_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4942_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4942_Task6" name="Execute draws/repayments against availability: fund the cash need (vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Execute draws/repayments against availability: fund the cash need (vendor payments VS-15, import settlements W232/W239, payroll VS-19.2) via draw, and sweep excess cash (collections VS-16, COD VS-142) to repay; record against the facility and update availability
Responsible (R): Cash Manager / Treasury / AP / Collections
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4942_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4942_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4942_Task7" name="Monitor &amp; alert: alert on availability thresholds (excess-availability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Monitor &amp; alert: alert on availability thresholds (excess-availability covenant, minimum-availability covenant, approaching cap), reconcile draws/repayments to the bank, and escalate constraint to the funding plan (VS-18.2/W233) and SCF (VS-105)
Responsible (R): Treasury / ABL Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4942_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4942_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4942_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4942_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4942_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-116 (ensure borrowing-base &amp; covenant compliance.) | - CTL-740: availability-first funding (no over-draw); daily availability reconciled to bank; covenant thresholds alerted; draws/repayments dual-approved
Owner: Treasurer / Cash Manager (VS-18) / ABL Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4942_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4942_Annotation9" targetRef="W4942_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
