    <bpmn:process id="W_W4943" name="W4943. Field Examination Coordination, Bank Audit Response &amp; True-Down Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Scheduled field exam (annual/semi-annual per agreement); bank-requested audit; availability event
Frequency: 1–2×/yr scheduled + event-driven
Volume: 1 field exam per facility per cycle × 1–3 facilities
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Finance / Internal Audit (VS-21)
Participants: Finance (VS-17), Treasury (VS-18), Inventory (VS-05), AR (VS-16), DC/Store Ops (VS-04/VS-07), Legal (VS-100), Internal Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4943 — Field Examination Coordination, Bank Audit Response &amp; True-Down Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4943_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4943_Lane1" name="ABL Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4943_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4943_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4943_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4943_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4943_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4943_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4943_Start4" name="Scheduled field exam (annual/semi-annual per agreement); bank-requested audit…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4943_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4943_Task5" name="Coordinate the field exam: scope with the bank&#x27;s examiner (inventory test-count…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Coordinate the field exam: scope with the bank&#x27;s examiner (inventory test-count at sampled DCs/stores, AR confirmation, eligibility/ineligible testing, advance-rate application, reserves), prepare the data pack (W4940/W4941 reconciliations, certificates, GL ties), and schedule site visits (VS-04/VS-07)
Responsible (R): ABL Manager / Finance / Inventory / AR
Accountable (A): Treasurer / Controller
Duration: Per exam</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4943_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4943_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4943_Task6" name="Support the exam &amp; respond: provide inventory/AR evidence, reconcile…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Support the exam &amp; respond: provide inventory/AR evidence, reconcile discrepancies, confirm AR (customer confirmations), and respond to findings; manage disputed ineligibles/true-downs with the bank
Responsible (R): Finance / Inventory / AR / ABL Manager
Accountable (A): Treasurer / Controller
Duration: Per exam</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4943_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4943_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4943_Task7" name="Manage true-downs &amp; remediation: if the exam reduces the borrowing base…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage true-downs &amp; remediation: if the exam reduces the borrowing base (ineligibles, over-statement, shrink), record the true-down, manage availability impact (W4942), remediate root cause (data, process, controls), and document for audit (VS-21) and the certificate (W4939)
Responsible (R): ABL Manager / Finance / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): CFO / Treasurer
Duration: Per exam</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4943_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4943_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4943_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4943_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4943_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-116 (ensure borrowing-base &amp; covenant compliance.) | - CTL-740: pre-exam self-test passed; inventory ≥97% accurate; AR reconciled; true-downs remediated and audited (VS-21)
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Finance / Internal Audit (VS-21)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4943_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4943_Annotation9" targetRef="W4943_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
